{"id": "claim_09038093d9a000c99aeace01330a48caf661984fe5badf3cd03f77be5582e4db", "title": "Open problem: Extended states for the three-dimensional Anderson model at weak disorder", "body": "OPEN PROBLEM (source_says_open; current status unverified; result status attempted_unsolved). Prove existence of absolutely continuous spectrum (delocalised states) for the random Schrodinger operator -Delta + lambda V on Z^3 at small disorder lambda, and GOE local statistics for its finite-volume restriction. Source: Bourgade: Random band matrices, ICM 2018 survey, Section 2.1, p. 7.\nPosed in Bourgade: Random band matrices, ICM 2018 survey\nCurrent status unverified as of 2026-09-07", "metadata_json": "{\"artifact_digest\":\"sha256:d2bd4abae8e90c9c25f1a2c6777a20a4ca2abda80ee5032a7f1bb4b781f3c764\",\"artifact_path\":\"objects/sha256/d2/d2bd4abae8e90c9c25f1a2c6777a20a4ca2abda80ee5032a7f1bb4b781f3c764.md\",\"bundle_digest\":\"sha256:bee140cfde7d5bf56318732d7b8273e9824005d4b35903e078e74d929a549266\",\"bundle_entry_key\":\"op-c0056\",\"bundle_id\":\"population.probability-intake-claude-bulk-problems-and-exclusions-c004a\",\"claim_kind\":\"concept\",\"conditions\":[],\"domain\":\"probability theory\",\"draft\":\"claude-probability-1000-continue-0907/bundle_006.json\",\"evidence_ids\":[],\"logical_id\":\"math:probability.random-matrices:open-problem-c0056-extended-states-for-the-three-dimensional-anderson-model-at-weak-disor\",\"overlay_schema_version\":1,\"proof_text\":\"\",\"release_manifest_digest\":\"sha256:27ce636e4c81aa81a5dbf74798c83425e9bd5ce208c7c2ac89a1b27196ba3791\",\"revision_digest\":\"sha256:09038093d9a000c99aeace01330a48caf661984fe5badf3cd03f77be5582e4db\",\"source_id\":\"owner-probability-intake-claude-20260907:op-c0056\",\"source_revision\":\"author-checked-private-20260907-v1\",\"statement_fidelity_reviewed\":false,\"supersedes\":[],\"trust_class\":\"curated_secondary\",\"truth_status\":\"unverified\"}", "digest": "sha256:9e8bec7ecce04f0c9c1ab0d9e5c379bd635fda0004936